---
/* The page's script wires the History Lab's window-hours and
   compare-offset-days segmented groups through their data attributes. */
---

<section class="station-section" id="charts" aria-labelledby="charts-title">
  <h2 id="charts-title">History, graded and plain</h2>
  <p class="station-note">
    The same six hours with your thresholds banding the
    trace, and with <code>thresholds="none"</code> opting out into
    the neutral accent. The third panel holds four days of history
    alone: <code>window-hours</code> re-slices it to 6/12/24 h,
    and <code>compare-offset-days</code> overlays a prior day&rsquo;s trace
    shifted onto today&rsquo;s own x-axis, both a plain client-side
    re-slice of the same fetched points.
  </p>
  <div class="station-grid station-grid-charts">
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3>With thresholds: 12 · 20 · 28 km/h</h3>
      <meteo-wind-history-chart station-id="summit-logger"></meteo-wind-history-chart>
    </div>
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3>Without thresholds</h3>
      <meteo-wind-history-chart
        station-id="summit-logger"
        thresholds="none"
      ></meteo-wind-history-chart>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="station-filter-row">
    <div class="station-segmented" role="group" aria-label="Window">
      <button type="button" data-window="6" aria-pressed="true">6 h</button>
      <button type="button" data-window="12" aria-pressed="false">12 h</button>
      <button type="button" data-window="24" aria-pressed="false">24 h</button>
    </div>
    <div class="station-segmented" role="group" aria-label="Compare to a prior day">
      <button type="button" data-compare="0" aria-pressed="true">Off</button>
      <button type="button" data-compare="1" aria-pressed="false">vs. -1 day</button>
      <button type="button" data-compare="2" aria-pressed="false">vs. -2 days</button>
      <button type="button" data-compare="3" aria-pressed="false">vs. -3 days</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="station-grid station-grid-charts">
    <div class="station-panel">
      <h3>History Lab: four days fetched, window-hours + compare-offset-days</h3>
      <meteo-wind-history-chart
        id="history-lab"
        window-hours="6"
      ></meteo-wind-history-chart>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
